        {
          "text": "Ū Ntemi Nebukadineza wibakīla, ūbūūka wangū wangū kūnū alīkumya; ūbabūūja a baganikīji bakwe, “Bing'we baalī batī badatū a banhū abo twalī twabatunga tūbaponya ū mu moto?”",
